mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(217,217,217);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">4.教学内容及进度安排</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">/Course Content & Schedule</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">（</font></span><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Courier New';font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">按照教学周编排，应包含每节课教学内容及教学目标，如有作业及考核要求，请一并列明）</font></span><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:176.7000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>基本要求：</strong><strong> </strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">掌握中医药学的基础理论，如阴阳五行理论、脏腑理论、气血津液理论、药性理论、方剂组成原则、八纲、脏腑辨证；熟悉中医治疗原则、治法、中成药的应用方法；了解中医各科的临床病理特点和分型论治。通过课堂签到考察学生出勤情况，通过课后作业了解学生学习情况。</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>教学内容安排：</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第1课：绪论、阴阳五行学说（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">中医药学发展史：中医药学的起源、各时期代表著作、理论体系的建立、丰富的临床经验。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">中医药学的基本特点：整体观念和辨证论治两方面。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">中、西医两种理论体系的差异，中医药学的发展趋势。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">西医院校学习中医药学的意义和方法。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">阴阳学说的基本概念及其内容（阴阳的对立性、统一性两方面）。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">五行学说的基本内容，相生、相克、相乘、相侮关系及其临床应用。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第2课：脏腑生理（一）（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">藏象学说的基本概念。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">五脏六腑的生理功能及互相关系（一）。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第3课：脏腑生理（二）（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp; &nbsp; 五脏六腑的生理功能及互相关系（二）。</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第4课：脏腑生理（三）（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp; &nbsp; 气、血、津液、精等基本含义、来源、功能。津液的生成、输布与排泄。</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第5课：病因（一）（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp; &nbsp; 六淫的基本概念，其致病具有季节性、区域性、相兼性、转化性等共性以及各自病邪的性质与致病的特征。</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第6课：病因（二）（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">七情的含义，情志伤的概念及其治疗原则。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">痰饮、瘀血的基本概念、形成机理、致病特点、治疗原则。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第7课：诊法（一）（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">诊法的概念及其望、闻、问、切部分内容。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">望诊的含义及其内容。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第8课：诊法（二）（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">闻诊。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">问诊方法与内容。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">切诊的含义。切脉的部位与方法，常见病理脉的临床意义。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第9课：辨证（一）（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp; &nbsp; 辨证基本概念及其内容（八纲辨证、气血津液辨证、脏腑辨证）。</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第10课：辨证（二）（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp; &nbsp; 八纲辨证中表、里、寒、热、虚、实、阴、阳的临床证候、鉴别要点、治则及其各证之间的相互关系。</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第11课：辨证（三）（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp; &nbsp; 气、血、津液辨证基本概念及其各证型的临床证候、治则。</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第12课：治则与治法（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">“治未病”的观念。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">治疗原则内容（预防为主、治病求本、正治反治、标本缓急、扶正祛邪、同病异治与异病同治、因时因地因人制宜）等基本措施。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">八法（汗法、吐法、下法、和法、温法、清法、消法、补法）在临床具体应用及其代表方剂。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第13课：中药基本知识、方药概论（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">中药的性能：四气和五味、归经、升降浮沉。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">中药的用法（配伍、禁忌、用量）。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">方剂组成规律。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第14课：解表与补益方药（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">解表方药的概念、分类。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">荆芥、防风、菊花、柴胡等的性味、功效、应用、用量、用法、注意点。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">荆防败毒散、银翘散的组成、用法、功效、主治、方解、注意点。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">补益方药的概念、分类。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">人参、黄芪、当归、何首乌、沙参、麦冬、仙灵脾、杜仲等的性味、功效、应用、用量、用法、注意点。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">四君子汤、四物汤、六味地黄丸、金匮肾气丸的组成、用法、功效、主治、方解、注意点。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第15课：清热与祛痰止咳平喘方药（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">清热方药和祛痰止咳平喘方药的概念、分类。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">上述须掌握中药的性味、功效、应用、用量、用法、注意点。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第16课：理气、活血祛瘀与泻下方药（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理气、活血祛瘀和泻下方药的概念。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">掌握中药的性味、功效、应用、用量、用法、注意点。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第17课：中成药（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">常用中成药不同剂型的作用特点。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">掌握常用中成药的组成、功效与主治、用法与用量、按语。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第18课：慢性支气管炎、支气管哮喘、冠状动脉粥样硬化性心脏病（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">慢性支气管炎、支气管哮喘的中医学认识（喘证和哮病的概念、病因病机、诊查要点、辨证论治）。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">冠状动脉粥样硬化性心脏病的中医学认识（胸痹的概念、病因病机、诊查要点、辨证论治）。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第19课：肝硬化、慢性胃炎（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">慢性胃炎的中医学认识。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肝硬化的中医学认识。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第20课：特发性血小板减少性紫癜、缺血性中风（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">特发性血小板减少性紫癜的中医学认识。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">缺血性中风的中医学认识。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第21课：外科（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<ol style="text-align: justify;">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">外科学概述（病因、辨证、治法）。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">疔疮、脱疽、乳痈、痔各期的辨证鉴别要点、主要证候、治疗方法、代表方药。</span></li>
</ol>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第22课：妇科（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp; &nbsp; 妇科学概述（病因、辨证、治法）。</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第23课：儿科（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp; &nbsp; 儿科学概述（病因、辨证、治法）。</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第24课：肿瘤（2课时90分钟，理论课）</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp; &nbsp; 肿瘤学概述（病因、辨证、治法）。</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">*见习课：根据各医院带教教师情况安排，见习内容为相应理论授课内容的临床实际应用。</span></p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
